mg\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116700/extras/3d4fdcaa8dd75605a158409e709f2eb9.poster.avif?t=1755484173\" width=600 height=337 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116700/extras/3d4fdcaa8dd75605a158409e709f2eb9.webm?t=1755484173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116700/extras/5aa612f4ecf2d6c801926a700bc21790.webp?t=1755484173\" width=616 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will get rewards by defeating evil spirits and monsters in <strong>Rest in Peace</strong>. Those rewards can enhance the power of their avatars in different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By picking up some of those rewards, players\u2019 avatars can learn various spell-like skills; Meanwhile, combine those skills to create the strongest packages of skills for follow-up battles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can adjust their skill packages at any time: changing choices of skills, selecting the appropriate combination of skills, decide the direction of enhancement of skills, which will make every second of battles a brand-new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116700/extras/1e3aeae01ea511a7639ebc14b931005d.poster.avif?t=1755484173\" width=600 height=337 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116700/extras/1e3aeae01ea511a7639ebc14b931005d.webm?t=1755484173\" typ